      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COLDFRONT (5) showed good gate speed on debut last start to find the lead as the $2.40 favourite and kept fighting to the line only to find one better over 1710m at Goulburn, beaten just a nose. Meets a similar line up and looks well placed to go one place better. UNDERSTATED EDGE (3) lines up for the first time. By Downbytheseaside and hails from the Jackson Painting stable. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a soft trip in the running. Has the right credentials to play a major role. INTIMATE DANGER (7) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by a nose at Goulburn over 1710m in the same race as the top selection. SHELBY ART (2) faces the starter for the first time. By Art Major and hails from the R F Ryan stable. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Was not far away in a recent trial. Any late push in betting will add to the confidence.",
